Set UNIX on Cosmopolitan.

CMake doesn't set UNIX for the cosmo system, so the if(UNIX) branches
(libtool .la files, syslog logger, UnixPasswordValidator) were skipped.
Cosmo is POSIX; WIN32 stays false.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@
 include(CMakeMacroLibtoolFile)
 
 project(tigervnc)
+set(UNIX TRUE)
 set(VERSION 1.16.2)
 
 # The RC version must always be four comma-separated numbers
